        "tekst": "**Chapter 16, part 1 in one breath**\n\nPower is getting your way; authority is power people accept, through tradition, rules or charisma. States range from totalitarian to democratic. Politics globalises, women stay under-represented, and three models argue about who really rules. Revolution, terrorism and war are power beyond the rules."
